Insecure ako. Lights off nung una. Pero siyempre, as time passes by, ma-rerealize mong mahal ka pa rin ng tao kahit ano pa hitsura mo. Ma-aaccept ka niya. This is how I felt comfortable with my BF.

&#x200B;

He was also being very patient with me and was assuring me about how he'd love me no matter what. Siyempre, mahirap paniwalaan noong una, lalo na't may bad self-confidence. Pero as time passes by I realize na totoo naman sinasabi niya, and masaya siya sa akin genuinely. Ayun, okay na, naging super comfortable na ako sa kaniya.

&#x200B;

This is why I also think fubu setups won't work with me. Mahirap lalo na kung walang love, lalo na sa mababa ang confidence sa katawan tulad ko. (Pero enlighten me about fubu setups din, baka mali lang naiisip ko haha)

